              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamuuni ammalle waan jed'eeni, AABBO Waaqa, dubbi anini si gaafad'u tana naa araarami; wonti akasitiifi anini nama, waan tokole siini jechu himmalle. ",
          "type": "text",
