          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo ammo nama shantama ka ch'ubbu inqamne suni keesa nami shani keesaa hafe, worra shanani suni jette dira kana imballeesita? AABBO Waaqi waan jed'eeni, Yo nama afurtami shani achiti arge imballeesu.",
