        {
          "text": "Abrahamuuni ammalle waan jed'eeni, AABBO Waaqa, nati indallaniini, amma toko ch'alla si gaafad'a. Yo nami kud'ani ch'allaani ka ch'ubbu inqamne Sodoma keesa jiraate ho? AABBO Waaqi waan jed'eeni, Anini lafa suni inhobaasu, yo nami kud'ani ka d'uga qabu keesa jiraate. ",
